      "id": "83c15ffc-0200-4129-9078-79a66ffcd36b",
      "code": "REQ-002",
      "title": "User Login",
      "description": "The system shall allow a registered user to log in using their email and password. After 5 consecutive failed attempts, the account is locked for 15 minutes.",
